,"video_desc":"为逃避“克妻”世子的婚约，将军之女黎婉铭当街抢亲，却错绑了病弱书生程立青。两人假成亲，约定十日后和离。黎婉铭不知，她捡回的“软饭夫君”，正是那位传闻中的“阎王世子”萧靖南。自此，鸡飞狗跳的契约生活开启，智斗刻薄亲戚，笑对伪装成补丁农户上门认亲的戏精公婆（宁王夫妇）。在联手创业、共抗危机的闹腾日常中，假戏悄然成真。当世子马甲摇摇欲坠，这对欢喜冤家必须决定，是将错就错，还是将这场荒唐闹剧结束。","series_id":"7606570659761638424","episode":true,"vertical":true,"content_type":1,"recommend_info":"{\"channel_id\":\"94349560332\",\"request_id\":\"2026110623574960CA04A9F76B7A96E3F5\",\"rank\":\"3\",\"queue_names\":\"shortplay\",\"final_queue_name\":\"heji\",\"gid\":\"7606570659761638424\",\"plan_id\":\"1\",\"is_show_ad_flag\":\"0\",\"series_pred_score\":\"{\\\"staytime_stream\\\":1.3645288944244385,\\\"absolute_staytime\\\":0.21291227638721466,\\\"collect\\\":0.050330642610788345,\\\"stream_ctr\\\":0.03618664667010307,\\\"like\\\":0.07807816565036774,\\\"finish\\\":0.028870906680822372,\\\"normalized_duration\\\":1.1588879823684692}\"}","recommend_group_id":"7606570659761638424","play_cnt":476339,"book_exist":false,"copyright":"硕才短剧","sub_title":"爱情·古风爱情","score":"8.1","use_video_model":true,"episode_cnt":82,"video_platform":3,"disable_play":false,"category_schema":"[{\"category_id\":5000,\"name\":\"爱情\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5000&categoryName=爱情&genreType=130&gender=0&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5051,\"name\":\"古风爱情\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5051&categoryName=古风爱情&genreType=130&gender=0&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5097,\"name\":\"闪婚\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5097&categoryName=闪婚&genreType=130&gender=0&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5095,\"name\":\"先婚后爱\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5095&categoryName=先婚后爱&genreType=130&gender=0&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5268,\"name\":\"世子\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5268&categoryName=世子&genreType=130&gender=0&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5280,\"name\":\"欢喜冤家\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5280&categoryName=欢喜冤家&genreType=130&gender=0&sou